From f414b0cfaeca5635e99a7c76d10c8c4d1cc8e4db Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: AjHomelab <31621065+Ajay9o9@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Mon, 9 Nov 2026 07:03:22 +1100
Subject: [PATCH] dflash : add DSpine draft model support

Imported from Ajay9o9/llama.cpp@dspine (d493f841b) into the mesh-llm patch
queue, with a zero-lattice fallback for probe/chunked (non-block-shaped)
batches so the nextn readout stays defined, and a docs/speculative.md
section for the DFlash2-detected DSpine path.
